{"title": "Sentinel: Opportunity Advantage", "pageid": 21524, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sentinel:_Opportunity_Advantage", "categories": ["Passive features", "Applies to Wild Shape"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sentinel_Opportunity_Advantage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Sentinel_Opportunity_Advantage.webp/300px-Sentinel_Opportunity_Advantage.webp, /w/images/9/94/Sentinel_Opportunity_Advantage.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Sentinel_Opportunity_Advantage.webp/300px-Sentinel_Opportunity_Advantage.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Sentinel_Opportunity_Advantage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Sentinel: Opportunity Advantage</b> is a passive feature obtainable by the <a href=\"/wiki/Sentinel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sentinel\">Sentinel</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>. Users of this feature gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attacks</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attacks</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Sentinel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sentinel\">Sentinel</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blythe\" title=\"Blythe\">Blythe</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cirian\" title=\"Cirian\">Cirian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Derysia\" title=\"Derysia\">Derysia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Eni\" title=\"Eni\">Eni</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Feona\" title=\"Feona\">Feona</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fustian\" title=\"Fustian\">Fustian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Glyria\" title=\"Glyria\">Glyria</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hoarding_Merregon\" title=\"Hoarding Merregon\">Hoarding Merregon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kevo_Phogge\" title=\"Kevo Phogge\">Kevo Phogge</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/M%27alice\" title=\"M'alice\">M'alice</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Merregon_Legionnaire\" title=\"Merregon Legionnaire\">Merregon Legionnaire</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mitchia\" title=\"Mitchia\">Mitchia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nov_Shmoz\" title=\"Nov Shmoz\">Nov Shmoz</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rycke\" title=\"Rycke\">Rycke</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spaulder\" title=\"Spaulder\">Spaulder</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vengeful_Merregon\" title=\"Vengeful Merregon\">Vengeful Merregon</a></li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201101\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 624/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3360/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2041/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1033/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 696933/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.173      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   31.173      1 -total\n 47.75%   14.886      1 Template:PageSeo\n 46.81%   14.591      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 28.85%    8.995      2 Template:Advantage\n 27.93%    8.708      1 Template:Icon_link\n 26.91%    8.389      1 Template:Icon_text\n 23.31%    7.268      2 Template:Trim\n 20.60%    6.422      1 Template:Ifempty\n 11.76%    3.665      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:21524-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201101 and revision id 168563. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}